ositta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Thanks for keeping the toggle instant by transforming cached fills and for routing the fetch through the perps controller. I’m requesting changes because the new `flattenFills` key can discard valid Hyperliquid executions, the generated individual row IDs change when history changes, and the custom `ButtonBase` control does not expose checkbox semantics. These affect trade history accuracy, Activity Details resolution, list stability, and accessibility. Please preserve provider execution identity end to end, remove non unique deduplication, use the design system `Checkbox`, and add the regression cases described in the inline comments. The positional boolean API is nonblocking, but an explicit options object would make this path safer to extend.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pull/36415#pullrequestreview-5239209475","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/36415","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pull/36415#pullrequestreview-5239209475"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/36415"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-17T17:28:47Z","commit_id":"707e36971ea3e4cac33209f041adb9b9983bf7dd"}]